      "content": "it's not just the money though. it's everything. i see the way my wife looks at the pile of letters on the table and she just gets this look in her eyes... like she's exhausted just being married to me. i'm just adding more stress to her life every single day. it feels so logical that the only way to actually help them is to just... stop being a problem for them.",
